□[0s,∞) {"../Lex/example/GDPR/gdpr.lex:1639:1-1646:45"}{∀a. ∀c. ∀cr. ∀ds. (∃d. ∃pr. ((DataProcessing(pr, c, a, d) ∧ IsIndirectCollection(a, d, ds)) ∧ HasStorageCriteria(d, cr)) ∧ ¬Exception96(a, c, ds)) →:R CanDelayInform(c, ds, a) U[0s,1M]:R ⧫[0s,∞) (∃de. ∃re. Inform(c, ds, de) ∧:L Contains(de, re) ∧:L IsStorageCriteria(re, cr))}